# A GLO piece turns its engines on through their levels. Named keys stay on top.
# Under four synth keys, the piece changes nothing that was already on.
# At four, the oldest named key goes off so the piece fits. The engines stay.
# Seed 42 opens on piece 2. One detent is piece 3, and that piece sounds all four.
seed 42
reboot
wait 80
expect piece 2
expect iammask 65
expect iamlay 0
tap GLO
wait 40
turn PRESET 1
wait 40
expect piece 3
expect iammask 65
expect iamlay 0
tap EDIT
wait 40
expect toast MUTATE BEAT
expect toast2
tap HOME
wait 80
expect iam 1
seed 42
reboot
wait 80
key w1 down
wait 40
key w1 up
key w2 down
wait 40
key w2 up
key w3 down
wait 40
key w3 up
key w4 down
wait 40
key w4 up
wait 1500
expect iammask 78
expect iamlay 1
tap GLO
wait 40
turn PRESET 1
wait 40
expect piece 3
expect iamlay 0
expect iammask 78
